<title>GERMANY: Hannover Re  96 pre-tax profit up 36 pct.</title>
<headline>Hannover Re  96 pre-tax profit up 36 pct.</headline>
<text>
<p>FRANKFURT, June 5, Reuter - Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     158	up 36 pct</p>
<p>    Parent after-tax profit		   92	up 14 pct</p>
<p>    Group premium income (approx)	  6,400    up 7 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German reinsurer is Hannover Rueckversicherungs AG. The results are preliminary and were issued at a news conference in Frankfurt by Hannover Re's management board chairman Wilhelm Zeller. The company also said shareholders could expect a double-digit percentage rise in the dividend payout.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
